#: ../../openmvcam/shields/ae3-battery-shield.rst:71
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/ae3-battery-shield.rst:73
msgid ""
"Plug an AE3 onto the shield and connect any one of the three power inputs — "
"the shield ORs the rails internally and feeds the AE3 from whichever source "
"is present."
msgstr "将 AE3 插到扩展板上，并连接三路电源输入中的任意一路——扩展板会在内部对各电源轨进行或运算，并从存在的电源中为 AE3 供电。"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/ae3-battery-shield.rst:79
msgid ""
"With only ``BAT`` connected (no USB, HV PWR, or Qwiic 3.3 V feeding the "
"shield), the AE3 runs at 3.0 V off the Li‑Po, the charger is idle, and both "
"status LEDs are off."
msgstr ""
"在仅连接 ``BAT``\\ （没有 USB、HV PWR 或 Qwiic 3.3 V 馈入扩展板）时，AE3 以 3.0 V "
"由锂聚合物电池供电，充电器处于空闲状态，两个状态 LED 均熄灭。"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/ae3-battery-shield.rst:83
msgid ""
"The microSD socket is exposed on the AE3's SPI bus through "
":class:`machine.SPI` and the standard ``sdcard`` driver. Drive ``P11`` high "
"to power the card, then wrap the block device in a ``VfsFat`` and mount it "
"at ``/sdcard``::"
msgstr ""
"microSD 插槽通过 :class:`machine.SPI` 和标准 ``sdcard`` 驱动暴露在 AE3 的 SPI 总线上。将 "
"``P11`` 拉高以为卡供电，然后将块设备封装进 ``VfsFat`` 并将其挂载到 ``/sdcard``::"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/ae3-battery-shield.rst:101
msgid ""
"Watch the charger status by reading its two status pins. ``P6`` (power‑good)"
" goes low as soon as 3.3 V is present on the shield — from USB, HV PWR, or "
"3.3 V fed back through the AE3's Qwiic — which is also when the charger is "
"allowed to run. ``P7`` (charging) goes low while the Li‑Po is actually being"
" charged. Both pins also drive on‑board status LEDs — ``P6`` lights a "
"**green** LED, ``P7`` lights a **red** LED::"
msgstr ""
"通过读取充电器的两个状态引脚来监视其状态。一旦扩展板上存在 3.3 V——来自 USB、HV PWR 或通过 AE3 的 Qwiic 馈回的 3.3 "
"V——\\ ``P6``\\ （电源正常）便变为低电平，这也是允许充电器运行的时刻。在锂聚合物电池实际充电时，\\ ``P7``\\ "
"（充电中）变为低电平。这两个引脚还驱动板载状态 LED——\\ ``P6`` 点亮一个 **绿色** LED，\\ ``P7`` 点亮一个 **红色**"
" LED::"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/ae3-battery-shield.rst:123
msgid ""
"Monitor the Li‑Po battery and LV input voltages on ``P8`` and ``P9``. The "
"shield divides each supply down to the AE3's 1.8 V ADC range, so scale the "
"reading back up by the input's full‑scale range::"
msgstr ""
"在 ``P8`` 和 ``P9`` 上监测锂聚合物电池电压和 LV 输入电压。扩展板将每路电源分压到 AE3 的 1.8 V ADC "
"范围内，因此请按输入的满量程范围将读数按比例放大回去::"
